{"seq":4,"slug":"hyperparameter-tuning","title":"超参数调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/training-and-optimization/hyperparameter-tuning","wordCount":962,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"超参数调优\">超参数调优</h1><h2 id=\"什么是超参数\">什么是超参数</h2><p>超参数（Hyperparameters）是在训练开始之前设定的参数，不通过训练数据学习，而需要人工（或自动化方法）指定。它们直接影响模型的容量、训练速度和最终性能。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>模型参数</th>\n<th>超参数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>来源</td>\n<td>训练中学习</td>\n<td>训练前设定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>示例</td>\n<td>权重 w、偏置 b</td>\n<td>学习率、层数、正则化强度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优化方式</td>\n<td>梯度下降</td>\n<td>网格搜索、贝叶斯优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;超参数类型&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; B[&quot;模型结构&lt;br/&gt;层数、隐藏单元数&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;训练过程&lt;br/&gt;学习率、batch size&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;正则化&lt;br/&gt;dropout rate、L2 λ&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;优化器&lt;br/&gt;momentum、Adam β&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"超参数类型\"]\n    A --&gt; B[\"模型结构&lt;br/&gt;层数、隐藏单元数\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"训练过程&lt;br/&gt;学习率、batch size\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"正则化&lt;br/&gt;dropout rate、L2 λ\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"优化器&lt;br/&gt;momentum、Adam β\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>超参数调优围绕三个概念展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>超参数 vs 模型参数</strong>：模型参数由训练学习得到（权重、偏置），超参数则由人指定（学习率、层数、正则化强度）。这个区分决定了优化手段不同：前者用梯度下降，后者靠搜索。</li>\n<li><strong>搜索空间与预算</strong>：每个超参数的取值范围构成搜索空间，而&quot;能跑多少次评估&quot;是硬约束。<strong>搜索方法的优劣，本质上是在固定预算下找到更好解的能力差异</strong>——这正是随机搜索胜过网格搜索的原因。</li>\n<li><strong>代理模型（Surrogate Model）</strong>：一个便宜地近似&quot;超参数 → 性能&quot;的模型。它使&quot;下一步该试哪里&quot;变成一个有信息的决策，而不是盲搜——这是贝叶斯优化与网格/随机搜索的根本区别。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>由此可以推出一个选型规律：<strong>评估便宜时用随机搜索，评估昂贵时用贝叶斯优化</strong>。末尾&quot;先粗后细&quot;和优先级建议同样是预算约束的直接推论。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"网格搜索-grid-search\">网格搜索（Grid Search）</h2><p>网格搜索是最直接的超参数搜索方法：穷举所有超参数组合，通过交叉验证评估每组性能。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from sklearn.model_selection import GridSearchCV&#10;from sklearn.svm import SVC&#10;from sklearn.datasets import load_iris&#10;&#10;iris = load_iris()&#10;&#10;param_grid = {&#10;    &#39;C&#39;: [0.1, 1, 10, 100],&#10;    &#39;gamma&#39;: [0.001, 0.01, 0.1, 1],&#10;    &#39;kernel&#39;: [&#39;rbf&#39;],&#10;}&#10;&#10;grid = GridSearchCV(&#10;    SVC(), param_grid, cv=5,&#10;    scoring=&#39;accuracy&#39;, verbose=0, n_jobs=-1&#10;)&#10;grid.fit(iris.data, iris.target)&#10;&#10;print(f&quot;最优参数:   {grid.best_params_}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;最优分数:   {grid.best_score_:.4f}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;搜索组合数: {len(grid.cv_results_[&#39;params&#39;])}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.model_selection </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GridSearchCV</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.svm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SVC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.datasets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_iris</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">iris </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_iris()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">param_grid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'C'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'gamma'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.001</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'kernel'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rbf'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">grid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GridSearchCV(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    SVC(), param_grid, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cv</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    scoring</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'accuracy'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">verbose</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_jobs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">grid.fit(iris.data, iris.target)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"最优参数:   </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">grid.best_params_</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"最优分数:   </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">grid.best_score_</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"搜索组合数: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(grid.cv_results_[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'params'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>简单直观</td>\n<td>计算成本随维度指数增长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保证覆盖所有组合</td>\n<td>高维超参数不实际</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合小搜索空间</td>\n<td>无法利用先验知识</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"随机搜索-random-search\">随机搜索（Random Search）</h2><p>随机搜索从超参数分布中随机采样组合。Bergstra &amp; Bengio (2012) 证明，随机搜索通常比网格搜索更高效。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 网格搜索&#10;        A[&quot;均匀网格采样&lt;br/&gt;可能错过最优区域&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 随机搜索&#10;        B[&quot;随机采样&lt;br/&gt;更好覆盖重要维度&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 网格搜索\n        A[\"均匀网格采样&lt;br/&gt;可能错过最优区域\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 随机搜索\n        B[\"随机采样&lt;br/&gt;更好覆盖重要维度\"]\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from sklearn.model_selection import RandomizedSearchCV&#10;from sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestClassifier&#10;from sklearn.datasets import load_wine&#10;from scipy.stats import randint, uniform&#10;&#10;wine = load_wine()&#10;&#10;param_distributions = {&#10;    &#39;n_estimators&#39;: randint(50, 500),&#10;    &#39;max_depth&#39;: randint(3, 20),&#10;    &#39;min_samples_split&#39;: randint(2, 20),&#10;    &#39;min_samples_leaf&#39;: randint(1, 10),&#10;    &#39;max_features&#39;: uniform(0.1, 0.9),&#10;}&#10;&#10;random_search = RandomizedSearchCV(&#10;    RandomForestClassifier(random_state=42),&#10;    param_distributions,&#10;    n_iter=50, cv=5,&#10;    scoring=&#39;accuracy&#39;, random_state=42, n_jobs=-1&#10;)&#10;random_search.fit(wine.data, wine.target)&#10;&#10;print(f&quot;最优参数: {random_search.best_params_}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;最优分数: {random_search.best_score_:.4f}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;搜索次数: 50 (vs 网格搜索可能需要 {5*17*18*9*10} 组合)&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.model_selection </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RandomizedSearchCV</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.ensemble </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RandomForestClassifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.datasets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_wine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scipy.stats </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> randint, uniform</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">wine </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_wine()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">param_distributions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'n_estimators'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: randint(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'max_depth'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: randint(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--sh