;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"最优参数: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">study.best_params</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"总试验数: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(study.trials)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Optuna 的核心特性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自动剪枝</td>\n<td>提前终止无望的试验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灵活搜索空间</td>\n<td>支持条件超参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可视化</td>\n<td>内置参数重要性分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布式</td>\n<td>支持多机并行优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持久化</td>\n<td>支持 SQLite 存储</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 超参数调优的优先级为：学习率 &gt; batch size &gt; 模型架构 &gt; 正则化参数。先粗略搜索确定量级范围，再在小范围内精搜。不要在不重要的超参数上浪费计算资源。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>超参数不通过训练学习，需要手动或自动搜索，对模型性能影响巨大。</li>\n<li><strong>网格搜索</strong>简单但效率低，<strong>随机搜索</strong>在高维空间更高效。</li>\n<li><strong>贝叶斯优化</strong>通过代理模型智能选择超参数，在评估代价高时优势明显。</li>\n<li><strong>Optuna</strong> 是现代超参数优化的首选工具，支持剪枝、并行和可视化。</li>\n<li>调优时应优先关注学习率和模型架构等高影响参数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"超参数调优","id":"超参数调优"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是超参数","id":"什么是超参数"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"网格搜索（Grid Search）","id":"网格搜索-grid-search"},{"level":2,"text":"随机搜索（Random Search）","id":"随机搜索-random-search"},{"level":2,"text":"贝叶斯优化（Bayesian Optimization）","id":"贝叶斯优化-bayesian-optimization"},{"level":2,"text":"Optuna","id":"optuna"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"正则化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/training-and-optimization/regularization"},"next":{"title":"数据预处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/feature-engineering/data-preprocessing"}}